Package: udon
Title: Gene Scoring via Network Propagation (UDON)
Version: 0.1.2
Authors@R: person("Qin", "Weng", email = "qsw@calicolabs.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Given a list of genes associated with a trait, scores all ~2,900
    proteins in a precomputed gene-regulation network by how strongly their
    activity propagates to those candidate genes. Optionally accepts per-gene
    effect sizes (e.g. rare-variant LoF betas) as weights; without them,
    unit weights are used (UDON_approx mode).
